!/.egm/DRIFT_STATUS.md
!/.egm/CONTRACTS.index
!/.egm/PAIRS.md
/.dev/
/docs/designs/
/build/
/.worktrees/

# The EGM.md contracts are tracked: a fresh CI checkout must hold the same
# inputs as a working tree, and the contract gate reads them. Only the
# contracts inside the vendored upstream trees stay out -- AGENTS.md §1
# leaves those trees to the sync, and a tracked EGM.md there would be a
# fork that the next sync deletes. The checker's config check fails if a
# bare EGM.md rule comes back and empties CI again.
crates/rgx-*/**/EGM.md
crates/rar-codec/**/EGM.md

# The working notes of this repository: the owner's and the agent's own file,
# on the machine, out of the tree and out of every upload.
/AGENTS.md

# Prototypal release scripts: a PGO build is two cargo runs and a profile merge.
pgo.sh
pgo.ps1
